          "id": "w-kya",
          "roman": "kya",
          "urdu": "کیا",
          "en": "what · (turns a sentence into a question)",
          "kind": "word",
          "note": "At the START of a sentence, kya makes a yes/no question, like \"Do…?\" / \"Are…?\"."
        },
        {
          "id": "w-nahi",
          "roman": "nahi",
          "urdu": "نہیں",
          "en": "no / not",
          "kind": "word",
          "note": "For \"not\", put it right before the verb: theek nahi hoon = not fine am."
        },
